        <body>
            <div xml:id="d380-a3">

                <pb facs="0664" n="536" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg536"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No.
                    23.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">republic of hayti</hi>.</head>
                <p>In view of the state of health of Mr. Adrian Van Bokkelen I come for and in the
                    name of the National Bank of Hayti to authorize by the present by the placing at
                    liberty of Mr. Van Bokkelen as far as regards the “<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >recommendation</hi>” which the bank had made against him on the register of
                    the prison.</p>
                <closer><signed>T. C. ANTOINE, <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Lawyer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
